{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_st02","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_st02","title":"信我所信","storyCode":"WB-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"182d6e562c6aea327585a11e3e055495efea3614000ce605726d156542d84f45","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"左乐终于拦下了截云，行事乖张的槐天裴再次阻止了他。林雨霞根据种种线索以及众人的反应，逐渐推测出了这一系列事情的全貌。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"narration","text":"我生在江边。\n爹跟我说，江水连通了整片大地，有一条够坚固的船，就能去任何地方。\n爹最讨厌下雪，大雪封门，没有“生意”可做，全家都得饿肚子。我的名字就是这样来的。\n我不晓得“生意”是什么，只是每个月底都见爹提着刀和物资回来，还有专门带给我的礼物。这时娘便一声不吭地分拣东西，帮爹浆洗沾血的袍子。\n直到有一天，一群穿着铠甲的人，攻破了寨子。爹一辈子都活在江上，最终也葬身江底。\n我只记住了为首的那个人。明明是大获全胜，但他看起来并没有多少欣喜，只是望着被血染红的江水出神。\n当时我只剩下一个念头。\n我要报仇。\n我打听到了那人的所在，也离开了家。从炎国的最东头，一直追到最西边。\n我才知道，原来大地上不止有江，还有数不尽的山川和原野。\n大地上的人们，有千万种活法，也有千万般辛苦。\n水寨太小了，如果爹能出来看看，或许不会选择半辈子都做那样的营生。\n爹说的不对。一艘船，能去的地方不多。\n我终于来到了玉门。那人就站在城头上，脸上是和那时一模一样的神情，我多少能看懂了些。\n我应该报仇。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑在槐武痴手里，以他的武功，左乐估计拿他没办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为这一个约定，他竟然在城里等了三年......倒是个有趣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合的伤势怎样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重伤太合先生的和前天刺杀魏彦吾的是同一人。她趁乱逃走，我不是对手，没能追上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在左乐封了铸剑坊，不少武人都被......控制了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾当前，现在守军和江湖人士又彻底撕破脸，玉门的局势只怕会更乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不能怪他冲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这件事，你自己不出手，解决不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左将军让我留守军营，我明目张胆跟他作对算怎么回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我说的不只是这几天的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你马上就要离开，临行前总要给城里的那些仰慕着你的人一个交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是你觉得，解释不清的事，回避就够了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都当你是我的学生，有时候连我自己都忘了你的来历，也将你当作录武官、左乐一辈的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我从没叫过你一声“老师”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也的确不能算是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的悟性很高，剑术多半是靠自己琢磨，我能教你的，本来就有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟是你对所有人隐瞒了我的身份，让我能留在玉门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总不能看着一个孩子再流落荒野......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从来不担心我会动手杀你？还是认定我永远都赢不了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要想报仇，又何必要在武功上胜过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算往饭里下毒，或者是在这城墙上推我一把，我也该死了千百遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只怕你杀了我，也没法放下执念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果不是跟在你身边五年，听到这种话，我一定会大骂你是世上最道貌岸然的伪君子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年，竟然有这么久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从你的视角看，未必是多长的一段时间吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这又怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十几年过去，一个人的相貌没有半点改变，脸上也总是挂着这副世事看尽的无奈表情，我再迟钝，也该明白你不是普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道这片大地上有一些寿命极长的种族，以前只是当故事听，没想到就在自己的身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你早就想到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不太在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只为报仇，你能活多长和我没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，总想着你不是普通人，不就等于在为自己找借口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你说的，徒步登高，只需要一步一步往上走就好了。其他的事情，想多了只是干扰心志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但一心惦记着恩怨、输赢，就算真的得偿所愿，未必就能放下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑上承载的杂念太多，就会变得迟缓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普通人，总得靠那一点执念活着......你又何尝不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得刚认识的时候，你说话还没这么“咄咄逼人”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这五年，我毕竟受了你不少教诲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我教你的，只是习武的心得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是你说的，你能教的有限，但学到的比教的多，也是各人的造化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说回来，你总该去见见那些还记挂着你的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是太多人的执念了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g9_yumensuburb"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个大块头不见了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然姑娘不是那伙贼人的同伙，又为何要偷剑？医馆那人和你又是什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不认识他们，我也不知道那人是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"显然你不清楚自己卷进了多大的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没在移动城市生活过，对玉门一无所知。有人告诉了你这把剑的位置，利用你将它盗走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这会招惹来怎样的麻烦，你并不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，事情或许还有挽回的余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了，没有谁指示，我只是为了报恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕自己会丢掉性命？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......反正你别再跟着我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管真相如何，我不能坐视一个无关的人因此陷入险境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在救你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘴上说得再好听也没用。你不是个好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我奉命追查，你盗剑在先，即使有些隐情，也不该颠倒黑白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就看你下令把工坊的那些师傅都抓去军营，你就不值得相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们试图掩护山海众逃离铸剑坊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是去保护那里的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在嫌疑没有洗清之前，一应人等都需严查。天灾当前，贼寇作乱，我要对玉门负责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的部族，只有年满十六岁、身体强壮的阿纳萨，族人才会为他打造专门的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得到武器的阿纳萨，就要永远保护老人小孩，和生病的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说是不能看着无关的人陷入险境，说是为了保护一座城市，就可以轻易将武器对准普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐职责在身......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师父说得对，你们这些人，因为有冠冕堂皇的理由可以说，就不觉得自己做错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还特地放慢了速度，结果一回头发现人没有跟上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑还在我手上，你俩反倒聊起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，左乐与二位有些误会，希望你可以交出佩剑，物归原主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听你们吵了半天，大概明白了意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此剑原来是那位宗师的东西，但是被这位小姑娘给偷偷带走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的武功出神入化，肯定不依赖哪一件具体的兵器。难道还能是他舍不得这把剑，派你来追的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中隐秘，不方便告知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是给他添了麻烦，那他卸任的日子又得往后拖......但我也答应过要帮这个小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......难办，难办。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大道理我懒得管，我倒有个直截了当的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们俩都算有点功夫，不如就在这儿打一架。都不许用武器，比拳头，谁赢了，我就把剑给谁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐。苍生大事，岂能儿戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不会动手的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我赶时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"narration","text":"梅花五点，拳脚相通；来留去送，甩手直冲。\n寸内发劲，力有对错；意投于外，一点精神......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"narration","text":"天蒙蒙亮，客栈里的伙计才开始擦桌扫地，准备今日伙房要用的食材。\n老鲤刚起床，后院已经传来羽兽晨鸣，以及，阵阵拳风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终究是父女，缘分哪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漂亮，漂亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有段时间没见过你打这套拳了，还以为你是忽然参透了什么心法，到了无招胜有招的境界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤叔又说玩笑话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武功可不是这么玄乎的东西，想要进步，只有靠日复一日的苦练。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得有理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得第一次让你帮事务所跑腿，就招惹到了一群不太规矩的帮派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我反应过来赶到的时候，只看到你站在倒了一地的黑帮打手中间，像个没事人一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候你才十六岁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在还没有太学会说话的时候，就已经开始习武了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么早的事也能记得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他告诉我的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在这方面，他把你教得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老话都说，“师父领进门，修行看个人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，其实“领进门”也是很重要的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能在他看来，这是作为父亲，唯一能为你做的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没有替他开脱的意思。他不是个称职的父亲，但这不该妨碍你过一个自己想要的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这身武功，你可以当作他送给你的礼物。要是不喜欢，就当是被报了一个不喜欢的兴趣班，扔下就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追求武学巅峰是他的道，但不一定是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不讨厌这身武功，我当然也有自己的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是龙门科技大学机械工程专业的优秀毕业生，是鲤氏侦探事务所的雇员，也是罗德岛的外勤干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是冬青木区大学生行侠仗义第一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要的话，我也可以是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然都想通了，下回见面的时候，把这些话告诉他就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤叔，你果然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然打一套好久不练的拳，总归是有原因的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说回来，考虑到他这些年不负责任的行为，你要是不服气，确实可以去找他打一架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"输了也没关系，他在你这个年纪，也未必就比你厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g9_yumensuburb"},{"type":"narration","text":"左乐作为秉烛人还很年轻，但处理过的大小事务，已经不能算少。\n但其中没有哪件事逼得他不能出手，他学过的武功，也没有教他该怎样只挨打而不还击。\n理亏吗？还是不愿欺负一个受伤的少女？\n雨点般的拳头落在左乐身上，左乐只是招架。\n两人双双摔倒在地，都是灰头土脸，少女还是不依不饶，挥拳越发拼命。\n场面滑稽得像是顽童打架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头叹气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得清楚，胜负已分，是这个小姑娘赢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我姑且放你走，等你报完恩，再回来还医药费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，你的刀也还给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看出来人家有伤，不还手，输倒也输得体面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也没必要用这种眼神看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘答应了我要回来，我信她。她要是言而无信，就是我看错人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帮你抓她回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么这么看着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来，没有受伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是意料之外还是失望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望你出事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闹了一些不必要的误会，让你陷入麻烦了，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才我已经和他们解释过了，没事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才这里的军士告诉我，我手里的那只袖标——你给我的那一只，本来是前天从城外带回来的证物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不打算解释一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你已经知道了，又何必要我来解释。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杜遥夜的拳头停在了半空中，林雨霞也没有躲闪的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们才认识不久，你不相信我也在情理之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要找一个人帮你去查铸剑坊，我可以同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不该用我朋友的事来骗我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停，打住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没资格跟我道歉，我不会原谅你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你们龙门人的做事方式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我自己的做事方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢，总不能白白让你利用这一趟，你查到什么有用的东西了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你知道的事都告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本只是一些怀疑，现在更加确信了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从城外发现信使队伍遇袭开始，我们遇到的每件事都充满蹊跷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在铸剑坊遇到山海众也并非巧合，这是那位姓孟的刀匠和他们有所勾结的最直接证据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是他......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有一人，有能力，也有理由一手策划这些事，那只能是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，他为什么要做这些事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我朋友的下落，你到底还知道多少？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚，但已经派人去查了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果按最坏的打算来看，不单单是信使队伍，整座玉门城恐怕都已深陷极大的危险中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿他的目的不在于此，或者是，还有后手......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"几十年了，孟铁衣极少站在门外打量自己这间作坊。\n待在里面时总觉得院子局促，从街上看，墙高砖厚，大门方正，倒还算气派。\n为期一月的集市已经到了最后几天，街上依旧熙熙攘攘，门庭冷落的铸剑坊反而因此显眼起来。\n“暂停营业”的牌子掉落在地上，取而代之的是两道白底红印的封条。\n黑漆木门上的黄铜铆钉不知何时掉了一个，自己竟然一直没有发现，也没有人提醒自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是老了，不中用了。最后一件事，也办不利索......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
